  "details": "The rescaling options for the popout/wing menu is tucked away on a radial puppet on the player's controller instead of IN the actual menu. \n\nThis is something that isn't accessible to all control methods, and something that you wouldn't even know existed if you didn't see it in patch notes at some point, or had someone point it out to you when asking if something akin to it even existed.\n\nWhy not just go with a commonly understood interaction like pinching the corners of the window to rescale it like most pc's everyone uses allow for example? Not everyone thinks to look at something literally not in their field of view, to fix something in their field of view, especially when it is menu related.",
